198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (Adam Brennan is a 19-year-old Irish attacking midfielder and winger currently playing for Shamrock Rovers in the League of Ireland Premier Division. A product of the UCD academy system, Brennan became the first player to progress through every age group at the club before breaking into senior football and earning a move to Shamrock Rovers ahead of the 2026 season. Operating primarily from the left side but capable of playing across attacking positions, he has begun accumulating Premier Division minutes within one of the strongest squads in Irish football. Brennan has represented the Republic of Ireland at underage level and earned his senior international debut against Canada in June 2026. The combination of age, technical ability, positional flexibility and early senior international recognition makes him one of the more interesting attacking development profiles currently emerging from the League of Ireland.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
